\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 **Lore Entry 15: GigaCorp and the Panoptes System** and \cf4 \cb5 \outl0\strokewidth0 **Lore Entry 16: The True Face of GigaCorp**\cf2 \cb3 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 In the expanse of The Convergence, GigaCorp stands as one of the largest financial conglomerates. It controls a vast swath of interstellar trade, banking, and currency exchange. While many appreciate the standardization and convenience that GigaCorp brings to the table, it's not without its share of controversy. Central to this controversy is their employee surveillance tool known as Panoptes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Panoptes, named after the all-seeing giant of ancient Earth mythology, is an advanced AI/ML system designed to analyze and optimize workforce behavior. Every GigaCorp employee is subject to the ever-watchful eyes of Panoptes. The surveillance starts the moment they step foot on a GigaCorp facility, with their biometrics and behaviors logged in real-time.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 GigaCorp facilities are fitted with advanced HD AV security cameras, capable of facial and speech recognition. These cameras are integral to Panoptes, tracking not just employee movement, but also analyzing non-verbal body language throughout the workday. This level of surveillance extends to remote work as well, with the system tapping into employees' web cameras and microphones.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Stress, focus, productivity - these are just a few of the many metrics that Panoptes tracks, alerting managers about any deviation from the norm. It is also capable of detecting any attempt to fake productivity, like keyboard bumping or mouse jiggling. The profiles created by Panoptes are incredibly detailed, leading to a hierarchy of employees based on their contributions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Despite the criticism, GigaCorp insists on the necessity of Panoptes. They argue that it is critical to safeguard the corporation against insider threats and ensure optimal productivity. However, many employees and privacy advocates argue that the surveillance is overly intrusive and fosters a culture of fear and paranoia.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Unfortunately, resistance to Panoptes has been mostly futile. The system is deeply entrenched in GigaCorp's operations, and employees who refuse to comply with the surveillance are often let go. This has led to a culture of compliance, with employees taking precautions such as covering their webcams, muting their microphones, and even using separate devices for work to minimize Panoptes' intrusion into their personal lives.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Despite these measures, the reach of Panoptes remains extensive. The system continues to refine its capabilities, adapting to new work patterns, and circumventing attempts to evade its surveillance. It has become a symbol of GigaCorp's unyielding control over its employees and a stark reminder of the lengths to which corporations in The Convergence will go to secure their interests.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 GigaCorp, despite its polished facade of being a financial giant in The Convergence, hides a sinister truth. Behind closed doors, it is a ruthless, omnipresent entity that seeks to manipulate and control for its selfish interests, making it one of the most feared organizations across the cosmos.\
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 One of the last bastions of unabashed capitalism in the human sphere, GigaCorp's influence extends far beyond its employees and customers. The Panoptes system, initially designed for workforce surveillance, has been extended covertly to unsuspecting citizens, creating an invisible web of surveillance that stretches across planets and star systems.\cb1 \
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 GigaCorp's surveillance and data gathering aren't just for corporate security or productivity measures; they form the backbone of a nefarious plan to control entire populations. By manipulating markets, influencing governments, and controlling information flow, GigaCorp has managed to turn free citizens into unsuspecting puppets. Those who resist or question GigaCorp's actions often find themselves facing financial ruin or social ostracization, thanks to the corporation's extensive influence.\cb1 \
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Worse still, GigaCorp is notorious for exploiting technologically underdeveloped societies. Using their superior technology, they pose as benevolent benefactors offering advanced technology in exchange for resources. But the cost is far more insidious. The technology provided often contains backdoors and surveillance tools that allow GigaCorp to monitor these societies, effectively turning them into unwitting corporate slaves.\cb1 \
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 GigaCorp's dark machinations don't stop there. They are constantly innovating and finding new ways to expand their control. It's rumored that they are researching Convergence Energy to develop technology that could control or manipulate MicroConvergence companions. If successful, they would be able to influence not just individuals but entire planets with hosts.\cb1 \
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Despite the mounting evidence against GigaCorp, the corporation continues to operate unchecked. Their economic clout and political influence make them seemingly untouchable. Those brave enough to expose GigaCorp's actions are often silenced, their warnings falling on deaf ears as the corporation continues to tighten its grip on The Convergence.\
\cf6 \cb1 \strokec6 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The true face of GigaCorp is one of ruthlessness, cunning, and unyielding control. It serves as a chilling reminder to all in The Convergence that not all threats come from alien races or cosmic anomalies; sometimes, the most dangerous enemy is the one that hides in plain sight.\cb1 \
}